==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|pulls down|pulling down|pulled down}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make (something) [[lower]] (especially of clothes).
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[demolish]] or [[destroy]] (a building etc.).
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To cause to fall to the floor
#* {{quote-journal
|en
