|author=Jon Smith
|title=Valencia 1 - 1 Chelsea
|work=BBC Sport
|url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/europe/14998331.stm
|page=
|passage=The home side got themselves in a mess again after 12 minutes when Victor Ruiz '''pulled down''' Ramires just outside the box. Lampard drilled a low free-kick past the wall but Diego Alves was down quickly to turn the ball away.}}

